The '''2024–25 season''' was the 118th season in the [[History of Real Betis Balompié|history]] of '''[[Real Betis]]''', and the club's tenth consecutive season in [[La Liga]]. In addition to the [[2024–25 La Liga|domestic league]], the club participated in the [[2024–25 Copa del Rey|Copa del Rey]] and the [[2024–25 UEFA Conference League|UEFA Conference League]], reaching the [[2025 UEFA Conference League final|final]] of the latter competition.

