== Friendlies ==
=== Pre-season ===
The pre-season began on 8 July, with the team camping in [[Seefeld in Tirol|Seefeld]], Austria from 10–20 July. The pre-season concluded on 10 August.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.realbetisbalompie.es/noticias/actualidad/definidas-las-fechas-y-lugares-de-concentracion-de-la-pretemporada-del-real-betis-30194|title=Definidas las fechas y lugares de concentración de la pretemporada del Real Betis|publisher=Real Betis|language=es}}</ref> The match on 7 August was supposed to be against [[Raja CA]], but the club was unable to travel due to internal issues.<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.realbetisbalompie.es/noticias/actualidad/el-real-betis-jugara-finalmente-contra-el-cadiz-cf-en-la-linea-30353|title=El Real Betis jugará finalmente contra el Cádiz CF en La Línea|publisher=Real Betis|language=es}}</ref>

